"规则立刻生效，不用重启内核，从上到下匹配。共享给 PS5 等设备的流量同样遵守这些规则；在「连接」页和「局域网共享」页的连接上右键也能直接加。" = "Rules take effect immediately without restarting the core, matching from top to bottom. Traffic shared with devices such as a PS5 follows these rules too; you can also add them by right-clicking a connection on the Connections and LAN Sharing pages.";
"局域网设备：按来源 IP 匹配经局域网共享上网的设备，比如让 PS5 走某个策略组。本机没开代理引擎时，设备规则里只有直连和拦截生效。" = "LAN device: matches devices going online through LAN sharing by source IP, for example sending a PS5 through a policy group. When this Mac isn't using the proxy engine, only direct and reject apply in device rules.";
"进程名：命令行工具这类没有 .app 的程序，比如 git、node、curl。" = "Process name: programs without an .app, such as command-line tools like git, node and curl.";
