/* UI/SharePage.swift */
"让 PS5、Switch、手机这些同一局域网里的设备把这台 Mac 当代理服务器，享受和本机一样的网络" = "Let devices on the same LAN, such as a PS5, Switch or phone, use this Mac as their proxy server and get the same network as this Mac";
"共享" = "Sharing";
"允许局域网里的设备经这台 Mac 上网" = "Allow devices on the LAN to go online through this Mac";
"现在转发到" = "Currently forwarding to";
"跟着本机走：本机开着代理引擎，共享的设备就用同样的节点和分流规则；本机用公司代理或者别的代理软件，就转发给它；本机没开代理，就经这台 Mac 直接上网。本机切换配置时，共享的设备几秒内跟着变。" = "Follows this Mac: when this Mac uses the proxy engine, shared devices use the same nodes and routing rules; when it uses a company proxy or another proxy app, traffic is forwarded there; when no proxy is on, devices go online directly through this Mac. When you switch profiles, shared devices follow within seconds.";
"共享由内核完成，还没有下载内核，到「内核」页下载" = "Sharing is done by the core, which hasn't been downloaded yet; download it on the Core page";
"正在监听端口 %@，局域网里的设备可以连接" = "Listening on port %@; devices on the LAN can connect";
"保持唤醒" = "Stay Awake";
"共享期间不让 Mac 睡眠（显示器可以关）" = "Keep the Mac from sleeping while sharing (the display can turn off)";
"电池供电时也保持" = "Also on Battery Power";
"Mac 一睡，设备的网就断了，所以共享开着时阻止空闲睡眠；默认只在接电源时保持，免得忘了关把电用光。合盖仍然会睡眠：接上电源和外接显示器（合盖模式）可以合着盖子用。程序退出或关掉共享后恢复正常，「活动监视器 → 能耗」里能看到是 Proxi Engine 在阻止睡眠。" = "When the Mac sleeps, devices lose their connection, so idle sleep is prevented while sharing is on. By default this only applies on power, so a forgotten share doesn't drain the battery. Closing the lid still sleeps the Mac; with power and an external display connected (clamshell mode) you can use it closed. Things go back to normal when the proxy engine quits or sharing is turned off, and Activity Monitor → Energy shows that Proxi Engine is preventing sleep.";
"正在保持唤醒" = "Staying awake";
"电池供电，已暂停保持唤醒" = "On battery; staying awake is paused";
"未保持" = "Not active";
"共享开启后生效" = "Takes effect when sharing is on";
"在 PS5 / Switch 上填写" = "Enter on the PS5 / Switch";
"代理服务器地址填 %@（这台 Mac 的 %@），端口填 %@" = "Set the proxy server address to %@ (this Mac's %@) and the port to %@";
"这台 Mac 还有别的网卡：" = "This Mac has other network adapters: ";
"。设备要和 Mac 在同一个网络里才连得上，按实际情况选。" = ". The device must be on the same network as the Mac to connect, so choose accordingly.";
"这台 Mac 现在没有连上局域网" = "This Mac isn't connected to a local network";
"PS5：设置 → 网络 → 设置 → 设置互联网连接 → 选中正在用的网络 → 高级设置 → 代理服务器 → 「使用」，填上面的地址和端口。Switch：设置 → 互联网 → 互联网设置 → 选中网络 → 更改设置 → 代理服务器设置。手机、电脑在 Wi‑Fi 的手动代理里填同样的地址。" = "PS5: Settings → Network → Settings → Set Up Internet Connection → select the network in use → Advanced Settings → Proxy Server → “Use”, then enter the address and port above. Switch: System Settings → Internet → Internet Settings → select the network → Change Settings → Proxy Settings. Phones and computers use the same address in the Wi‑Fi's manual proxy.";
"Mac 的 IP 变了设备就连不上了：建议在路由器里给这台 Mac 分配固定 IP，或者在 Mac 的网络设置里手动指定。PS5 只把 HTTP / HTTPS 流量（商店、下载、登录、浏览器）交给代理，游戏联机的 UDP 流量仍然直连。开着 macOS 防火墙时，第一次会询问是否允许 mihomo 接受传入连接，要允许。" = "Devices can't connect once the Mac's IP changes, so give this Mac a fixed IP in the router, or set one manually in the Mac's network settings. The PS5 only sends HTTP / HTTPS traffic (store, downloads, sign-in, browser) through the proxy; online gaming UDP traffic still goes direct. With the macOS firewall on, you'll be asked the first time whether to allow mihomo to accept incoming connections; allow it.";
"谁能用、用哪个端口" = "Who Can Use It, and Which Port";
"留空：局域网里的所有设备。或者填 192.168.1.20, 192.168.1.0/24" = "Leave empty for all devices on the LAN, or enter 192.168.1.20, 192.168.1.0/24";
"留空时同一局域网（10.x、172.16–31.x、192.168.x）里的任何设备都能用。在公共 Wi‑Fi 上最好填上 PS5 的 IP 只让它用，或者干脆关掉共享。本机自己总是允许的。" = "When empty, any device on the same LAN (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) can use it. On public Wi‑Fi, it's best to enter the PS5's IP so only it can use it, or just turn sharing off. This Mac itself is always allowed.";
"正在测试…" = "Testing…";
"经共享端口测试" = "Test Through the Sharing Port";
"默认 7892；不能用代理引擎自己的端口（%@ 和 %@）。改了端口，设备上也要跟着改。「经共享端口测试」从本机经这个端口访问测速地址，能确认入口和上游都通。" = "7892 by default; it can't be one of the proxy engine's own ports (%@ and %@). If you change the port, change it on the devices too. “Test Through the Sharing Port” requests the test URL from this Mac through this port, confirming the entry and upstream both work.";
"正在使用的设备" = "Devices Using It";
"还没有设备经这台 Mac 上网。PS5 上设置好后，打开商店或者测试互联网连接就能在这里看到它。" = "No devices are going online through this Mac yet. After setting up the PS5, open the store or test the internet connection and it shows up here.";
"共享开启后，这里会列出正在使用的设备。" = "Once sharing is on, devices using it are listed here.";
"按来源 IP 归并，只统计现在还开着的连接。右边的菜单能让某台设备固定走某个节点组、直连或者断网（设备规则在「分流规则」页里也能改）。" = "Grouped by source IP, counting only connections that are still open. The menu on the right pins a device to a node group, direct, or no network (device rules can also be changed on the Routing Rules page).";
"走：%@" = "Route: %@";
"跟随规则" = "Follow Rules";
"这台设备的所有连接%@" = "All Connections from This Device: %@";
"恢复跟随分流规则" = "Follow Routing Rules Again";
"本机用代理引擎时完全生效；本机用别的代理或直连时，只有「直连」「拦截」生效" = "Fully applies when this Mac uses the proxy engine; when it uses another proxy or goes direct, only “Direct” and “Reject” apply";
"%@ 个连接 · ↑ %@ ↓ %@" = "%@ connections · ↑ %@ ↓ %@";
" · 最近 %@" = " · last %@";
"设备经共享入口发起的连接会按时间列在这里：访问了哪个域名、走的是哪个节点还是直连、命中了哪条规则。" = "Connections made by devices through the sharing entry are listed here by time: which domain they accessed, whether they went through a node or direct, and which rule matched.";
"让设备 %@ 的所有连接…" = "Route All Connections from Device %@…";

