"所有程序的流量都经过代理引擎" = "All apps' traffic goes through the proxy engine";
"协议栈" = "Stack";
"系统代理只管认它的程序；终端里的命令、游戏和一些应用不认，照样直连。增强模式开一块虚拟网卡接管这台 Mac 的全部流量（DNS 查询也交给内核），按同样的规则和节点走。只在本机开着代理引擎时生效，关掉代理或者换成别的配置就自动停。" = "The system proxy only covers apps that respect it; commands in Terminal, games and some apps ignore it and connect directly. Enhanced mode adds a virtual network adapter that takes over all of this Mac's traffic (DNS queries go to the core too) and routes it with the same rules and nodes. It only works while this Mac uses the proxy engine and stops automatically when you turn the proxy off or switch to another profile.";
"让设备把这台 Mac 当路由器" = "Let Devices Use This Mac as a Router";
"路由器（网关）" = "Router (Gateway)";
"这台 Mac 现在没有局域网地址" = "This Mac has no LAN address right now";
"电视、游戏机、智能设备这类不能填代理、或者填了也有程序不走的设备，在网络设置里把 IP 改成手动（同一网段里一个空闲的地址，子网掩码和原来一样），「路由器」和 DNS 都填上面的地址，就经这台 Mac 上网。" = "For TVs, game consoles and smart devices that can't set a proxy, or have apps that ignore it: set the IP to manual in the device's network settings (a free address in the same subnet, same subnet mask), and enter the address above for both “Router” and DNS; the device then goes online through this Mac.";
"设备跟着本机走：本机开着代理引擎就用同样的节点和分流规则，本机用别的代理就转发给它，没开代理就直接上网；设备规则同样生效。这台 Mac 的地址最好在路由器里固定下来；开着 macOS 防火墙时要允许内核接受传入连接。要用到特权助手，和增强模式是同一个。" = "Devices follow this Mac: when it uses the proxy engine they use the same nodes and routing rules, when it uses another proxy traffic is forwarded there, and with no proxy they go online directly; device rules apply too. It's best to fix this Mac's address in the router, and with the macOS firewall on, allow the core to accept incoming connections. It needs the privileged helper, the same one as enhanced mode.";

