"PS5 的代理设置只对系统流量（联网测试、PSN、商店）和浏览器生效。如果打开某个应用时这里没有出现它的连接，说明那个应用用的是自己的网络栈、没走代理；用 PS5 的浏览器打开同一个网站可以对照。域名一栏如果是 IP，说明设备自己解析了域名，内核会从 TLS 握手里取回域名再分流。本机和设备的全部连接在「连接」页。" = "The PS5's proxy setting only applies to system traffic (connection test, PSN, store) and the browser. If an app's connections don't show up here, that app uses its own network stack and bypasses the proxy; compare by opening the same site in the PS5 browser. If the domain column shows an IP, the device resolved the name itself, and the core recovers the domain from the TLS handshake before routing. All connections from this Mac and devices are on the Connections page.";
"Proxi 的可选扩展：本机运行的代理引擎，由 Proxi 下载、启动和更新。在 Proxi 的「设置 → 扩展」里可以关闭或移除。" = "An optional Proxi extension: a proxy engine running on this Mac, downloaded, started and updated by Proxi. You can turn it off or remove it in Proxi's Settings → Extensions.";
"Proxi 的配置列表里的「代理引擎」就是它：开启后系统代理指向 127.0.0.1:%@，在这里选节点、切换模式。" = "This is the “Proxy Engine” profile in Proxi's profile list: when it's on, the system proxy points to 127.0.0.1:%@. Choose nodes and switch modes here.";
"Surge 格式的完整配置里有自己的 FINAL（其余流量的去向）。「跟随规则文件」用的是最后一个这样的规则集的 FINAL；纯规则列表没有 FINAL，全是列表时其余流量走节点。" = "Full Surge-format configs have their own FINAL (where everything else goes). “Follow Rule File” uses the FINAL of the last such rule set; plain rule lists have no FINAL, so with only lists everything else goes through a node.";
"Surge 格式的配置" = "Surge-format config";
