"在终端里直接运行代理引擎程序里的二进制并带上子命令（比如 status、nodes），经这个接口操作正在运行的代理引擎；只有你这个账户能连。完整的用法：" = "Run the binary inside the engine app in Terminal with a subcommand (such as status or nodes) to control the running engine through this interface; only your account can connect. Full usage:";
