"导入配置并生效（先用 preview_import 看看会改什么）。merge 加进现有设置、同名的更新；replace 用导入的内容替换同类设置。复杂的改动（DNS、Hosts、策略组的高级选项……）都可以写成代理引擎的配置描述 JSON 导入。" = "Import a config and apply it (use preview_import first to see what changes). merge adds to the current settings and updates items with the same name; replace replaces settings of the same kind. Complex changes (DNS, Hosts, advanced policy group options…) can all be written as an engine config description JSON and imported.";
"导出配置：describe 是代理引擎的配置描述（JSON，可以改了再用 import_config 导入）；backup 是完整备份；core 是生成的内核配置（YAML，去掉了密钥）。" = "Export the config: describe is the engine's config description (JSON; edit it and import it back with import_config); backup is a full backup; core is the generated core config (YAML, with secrets removed).";
"已下载并校验" = "Downloaded and verified";
"应用的路径，比如 /Applications/Safari.app" = "Path of the app, e.g. /Applications/Safari.app";
"应用：这个 .app 以及它的辅助进程发起的连接（按路径匹配）。比如让某个程序走节点、让某个下载工具直连。" = "App: connections made by this .app and its helper processes (matched by path). For example, send one app through a node and let a download tool connect directly.";
"开关增强模式（虚拟网卡）：本机在用代理引擎时，不认系统代理的程序的流量也经过内核，DNS 也交给内核。要先在设置的「高级」页装特权助手（要管理员密码，只能由用户自己装）。" = "Turn enhanced mode (virtual network adapter) on or off: while this Mac uses the engine, traffic from apps that ignore the system proxy also goes through the core, and DNS is handled by the core. The privileged helper must be installed first on the Advanced page in Settings (it needs an administrator password, so only the user can install it).";
"打开数据目录" = "Open Data Folder";
"支持代理引擎的 JSON、mihomo 的 YAML、Surge / Quantumult X 格式的配置、节点链接和规则列表" = "Supports the engine's JSON, mihomo YAML, Surge / Quantumult X format configs, node links and rule lists";
"查看代理引擎现在的状态：内核、节点和模式、局域网共享、增强模式、出口 IP。做任何操作前先看一下。" = "Show the engine's current state: core, node and mode, LAN sharing, enhanced mode and the exit IP. Check this before doing anything.";
"正则，比如 node-a|node-b；空为全部" = "Regex, e.g. node-a|node-b; empty means all";
"正在下载%@…" = "Downloading %@…";
"正在校验…" = "Verifying…";
"比如「甲 」，几个订阅来源的节点同名时好区分" = "e.g. “A ”, to tell nodes with the same name from different subscription sources apart";
"没在运行" = "Not running";
"没有检测：内核没在运行，或者正在检测别的网址" = "Not checked: the core isn't running, or another URL is being checked";
"版本" = "Version";
"筛选和排除按订阅里原始的名字匹配（不区分大小写），加前缀之前。前置代理：这个订阅的节点先经它再连出去（链式代理），比如先经公司的代理，或者先经另一个订阅的节点；不能选含这个订阅自己节点的组。" = "Filter and exclude match the original names in the subscription (case-insensitive), before the prefix is added. Front proxy: this subscription's nodes connect through it first (proxy chain), for example through your company proxy or a node from another subscription; a group containing this subscription's own nodes can't be chosen.";
"经%@访问 %@：%@" = "Through %@, %@: %@";
"经它检测网址…" = "Check a URL Through It…";
"经某个节点访问一个你填的网址，看能不能打开、返回什么状态、花了多久。选别的节点检测时不会切换你正在用的节点。" = "Open a URL of your choice through a node to see whether it loads, what status it returns and how long it takes. Checking through another node doesn't switch the node you're using.";
"经节点访问一个网址，看能不能打开、HTTP 状态和耗时。不写节点时用现在的节点；写了节点时临时经它检测，不影响正在用的。" = "Open a URL through a node and report whether it loads, the HTTP status and the time taken. Without a node, the current node is used; with a node, it's used just for the check without affecting the one in use.";
"给某类流量单独选节点：比如建一个组，分流规则里把某些域名指到它，这里就能单独给它选节点。" = "Pick a node for certain traffic: for example, create a group, point some domains to it in the routing rules, and choose its node separately here.";
"网址或域名，比如 example.com" = "URL or domain, e.g. example.com";
"网址或域名，比如 https://example.com" = "URL or domain, e.g. https://example.com";
"网址检测" = "URL Check";
"网址，比如 https://example.com" = "URL, e.g. https://example.com";
"能导入代理引擎的 JSON、mihomo 的 YAML、Surge / Quantumult X 格式的配置、节点链接和规则列表，也可以把文件直接拖进这个窗口。完整备份导入时选「替换」就能原样恢复；备份里有订阅地址，不要发给别人。内核配置是现在生成给 mihomo 的，供参考。" = "You can import the engine's JSON, mihomo YAML, Surge / Quantumult X format configs, node links and rule lists, or drag a file into this window. Import a full backup with “Replace” to restore it exactly; backups contain subscription URLs, so don't share them. The core config is what's currently generated for mihomo, for reference.";
"能打开" = "Loads";
"节点名筛选（正则），比如 node-a|node-b；空为全部节点" = "Node name filter (regex), e.g. node-a|node-b; empty means all nodes";
"节点名筛选（正则，不区分大小写），比如 node-a|node-b" = "Node name filter (regex, case-insensitive), e.g. node-a|node-b";
"虚拟网卡要管理员权限：第一次用时装一个特权助手（输一次密码），它只听你这个账户的话，只运行自己那份内核。「虚拟 IP」模式下 DNS 先回一个 198.18 开头的地址、连接时再按域名分流，不依赖本地 DNS 的解析结果；个别程序不适应时换成「真实 IP」。" = "The virtual adapter needs administrator rights: the first time, a privileged helper is installed (one password prompt). It only accepts requests from your account and only runs its own copy of the core. In “Virtual IP” mode, DNS first answers with an address starting with 198.18 and traffic is routed by domain when connecting, without depending on local DNS answers; switch to “Real IP” if an app has trouble with it.";
"要检测的网址" = "URL to check";
"要给一个网址，比如 https://example.com" = "Give a URL, e.g. https://example.com";
"规则地址：.list / .yaml / .mrs 列表，或者 Surge 格式的 .conf" = "Rule URL: a .list / .yaml / .mrs list, or a Surge-format .conf";
"订阅每 %@ 小时自动更新一次。内核以 clash.meta 的身份下载，订阅返回 mihomo 格式的配置或 base64 节点列表都可以。齿轮里能设筛选（只要某些地区、去掉「剩余流量」这类假节点）、名字前缀和前置代理。" = "Subscriptions update automatically every %@ hours. The core downloads them as clash.meta, so a subscription can return a mihomo-format config or a base64 node list. The gear menu sets filters (keep only some regions, drop placeholder nodes like “remaining traffic”), a name prefix and a front proxy.";
"认不出「%@」：填域名（比如 example.com）或 IP / 网段（比如 192.0.2.1、10.0.0.0/8）" = "Can't recognize “%@”: enter a domain (e.g. example.com) or an IP / range (e.g. 192.0.2.1, 10.0.0.0/8)";
"认不出这个网址：填 example.com 或者 https://… 这样的地址" = "Can't recognize this URL: enter something like example.com or https://…";
"认不出这是什么配置：支持代理引擎的 JSON、mihomo 的 YAML、Surge / Quantumult X 格式的配置、节点链接和规则列表" = "Can't tell what kind of config this is. Supported: the engine's JSON, mihomo YAML, Surge / Quantumult X format configs, node links and rule lists";
"说明" = "Documentation";
"读不了" = "unreadable";
"运行中（%@）" = "Running (%@)";
"还没有下载内核，到「内核」页下载" = "The core hasn't been downloaded yet; download it on the Core page";
"还没有下载内核，到设置的「内核」页下载" = "The core hasn't been downloaded yet; download it on the Core page in Settings";
"还没有订阅。把服务提供方给你的订阅地址粘到下面，节点由内核下载和解析。" = "No subscriptions yet. Paste the subscription URL from your provider below; the core downloads and parses the nodes.";
"选一个应用，或者填它的完整路径，比如 /Applications/Safari.app" = "Choose an app, or enter its full path, e.g. /Applications/Safari.app";
"重新下载" = "Download Again";
"隐藏代理引擎" = "Hide Proxy Engine";
"靠前的规则集先匹配，右边的菜单可以调顺序。纯规则列表（.list、.yaml、.mrs）由内核直接加载，更新不用重启；Surge 格式的完整配置（.conf）会转换后并入，默认按文件里写的策略走，添加后可以改成统一的去向。「走节点」用「节点与订阅」页里选中的节点，策略组的成员也在那一页设置。" = "Rule sets higher up match first; reorder them with the menu on the right. Plain rule lists (.list, .yaml, .mrs) are loaded by the core directly and update without a restart; full Surge-format configs (.conf) are converted and merged, following the policies in the file by default, which you can change to a single target after adding. “Through node” uses the node selected on the Nodes & Subscriptions page, where policy group members are set too.";
"预览导入会改动什么，不会真的改。内容可以是代理引擎的配置描述（JSON）、mihomo 的 YAML、其他常见格式的配置、节点链接或规则列表；也可以给网址。" = "Preview what an import would change without changing anything. The content can be an engine config description (JSON), mihomo YAML, configs in other common formats, node links or rule lists; a URL also works.";
"（在 Proxi 里开启「代理引擎」这个配置后生效）" = " (takes effect when the “Proxy Engine” profile is turned on in Proxi)";
"，本机端口 %@" = ", local port %@";
